OpenCode (https://github.com/sst/opencode)
Copyright (c) 2025 opencode
Licensed under the MIT License (full text below).

Adaptations:
- E3/E4 (packages/engine/src/checkpoints.ts): file-checkpoint mechanism adapted from
  OpenCode's snapshot module — a shadow git repository (separate GIT_DIR under the keywork
  data dir, work tree at the project root) captured via `git add -A` + `git write-tree` and
  restored via `git read-tree --reset -u`, so the user's own git state is never touched.

